{"channelId":"UCF6XeEaOLrOIurfdQt1yuUA","row":["Rabbit rescue & sanctuary",204,"🐰🐇 🩵🏡🌲I love the world of pets rabbits 🌎🐰🐇❤️\nI care deeply about rabbits and do my best to help them every day. I feed many rabbits in parks and neighborhoods, and I also try to rescue sick or injured rabbits by taking them for proper care and treatment whenever possible.\nThis work brings me great joy and purpose. It reflects kindness, compassion, cooperation, and a true love for animals and life.\nYou can support this mission by subscribing to my channel, watching and sharing my videos, and helping spread awareness about caring for rabbits. If you wish, you can also donate to the channel to help support the food, rescue, and medical care for these wonderful animals.\nPlease share my videos with your friends and help grow a community that cares for rabbits.\nThank you all for your kindness and support.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCF6XeEaOLrOIurfdQt1yuUA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCF6XeEaOLrOIurfdQt1yuUA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:50.772Z","channelId":"UCF6XeEaOLrOIurfdQt1yuUA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"c74cb1c28178cb9c2ffeaadfd7acaa3b62eb8c0d15f0c738af238e0d134adc94","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"db5dd7d6b5409fc6d7c41df0226d9591ca444c4a0ecef72cc2f9b8e07ca9c36b"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCF6XeEaOLrOIurfdQt1yuUA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":204,"raw":"204 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCF6XeEaOLrOIurfdQt1yuUA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:50.772Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reaso